statement:
Find the number of positive integers $n$ for which
\begin{enumerate}
\item[(i)] $n \leq 1991$;
\item[(ii)] $6$ is a factor of $n^2 + 3n + 2$.
\end{enumerate}

\begin{enumerate}
\item[(i)] Determine the set of all positive integers $n$ for which $3^{n+1}$ divides $2^{3^n} + 1$;
\item[(ii)] Prove that $3^{n+2}$ does not divide $2^{3^n} + 1$ for any positive integer $n$.
\end{enumerate}
